BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.77 Tm (The most expensive failures start with a job someone called dry. Melrose describes a house that had been dried that still) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.55 Tm (had saturated materials and fresh mold, and warns that three or four days of fans proves nothing; only monitoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.32 Tm (proves dryness [iQ4PIKW3sEc @ 00:02:41]. Balanced Building Biology names the concrete version the 2 cm trap:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.10 Tm (scanning meters miss moisture at the bottom of the slab, and the floor fails about three weeks later, which is why they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.87 Tm (call proper deep probing absolutely essential [YdUmzaa5wO0 @ 00:06:15]. Bijlsma turns that into a liability move,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.65 Tm (telling assessors to state in their disclaimer that they are unable to determine whether the concrete is dried beyond 2 cm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.42 Tm (and notes Don was paid $5,000 for three hours of lectures on AS 2180/2170 sleeve testing [r1JeD2hb2jM @ 00:41:14].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.20 Tm (Floyd adds the instrument traps: an infrared camera only says a surface is cooler and could be evaporation, so validate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.97 Tm (with a meter, and non-penetrating meters cannot read through an air gap while foil backing and metal throw false) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.75 Tm (readings [cPAFOZbMKQE @ 00:40:06]. Treat any reading you have not personally validated with a probe or a pin as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.52 Tm (unverified, and write the limitation into the file before the floor goes down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.30 Tm (The second cluster of failures is the crew spreading the problem it was hired to remove. Floyd warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.07 Tm (decontamination comes first, because rolling in a bunch of air movers before it just blows contamination around, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.85 Tm (that a non-HEPA shop vac aerosolizes waterborne pathogens [cPAFOZbMKQE @ 00:23:50]. Balanced Building) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.62 Tm (Biology sets the sequence as a hard rule: never demolish or place air movers before the room is sealed with 6 mil) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.40 Tm (fire-retardant poly, zip walls and critical barriers, and shop vacs and M-class extractors are not allowed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.17 Tm ([YdUmzaa5wO0 @ 00:02:30]. TheIICRC's S520 2015 briefing rejects misting disinfectants in lieu of source removal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.95 Tm (and warns that the rejected approach accomplishes a nice diffusion of the mold throughout the property, so it is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 91.72 Tm (recommended at all [6CI2NAsooLw @ 00:12:38]. Bijlsma flags a quieter trap on the testing side: a spore-free air) Tj ET
