BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Building Biology - YdUmzaa5wO0 @ 00:02:47].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Do not close a drying file on fan-days; close it on monitored readings taken with the same meter used throughout the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (project [Coach8 - 7gZTdFWoHgs @ 00:37:15].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Do not deviate without documenting it, communicating with affected parties and getting written owner authorization;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (an adjuster cannot impose limitations [Time's Dark Captains - y00Yi4bnLx4 @ 00:12:13].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Do not take mold work without a separate contractor's pollution liability policy, since general insurance almost always) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (excludes mold [Phill McGurk - Dl8DpDk97_A @ 00:04:27].) Tj ET
BT /F0 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (Pull Quote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.87 Tm (A deviation is not a license to do something wrong; it means there's another way to get there, kind of like a detour.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.65 Tm (Attributed to APPALeadership \(cPAFOZbMKQE @ 00:09:16\).) Tj ET
