BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.67 Tm (00:06:08].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.45 Tm ([ ] Map moisture with linear readings every 5 feet and floor readings every 5x5 feet, marking equipment and any) Tj ET
