BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 516.00 Tm (Kind: INSIDER PRO-TIPS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 500.77 Tm (Title: What the crews do that rookies skip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 485.55 Tm (Body: Small field habits the practitioners use to protect scans, odor results, and fragile contents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 470.32 Tm (Items: Drop the Matterport tripod to its lowest height and open the cabinets for under-sink water losses, and add 2 to 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.10 Tm (extra scans in tight bathrooms to cover the tripod blind spot [Adjuster TV - 86mEe0yHwiw @ 00:23:01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.87 Tm (Never let the homeowner do the laundry on a smoke job; it obscures the source of any remaining odor, so run it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 424.65 Tm (in-house or through a certified vendor, not "Suzy's Wash and Fold" [FirehouseEducation - MkCNqNRsk04 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 409.42 Tm (00:09:05].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.20 Tm (Send a second PM through the house for a "fresh nose" odor assessment before the final walkthrough [Octagon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 378.97 Tm (Cleaning and Restoration - WTz841eMFkk @ 00:06:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 363.75 Tm (On a floor mirror, unscrew the 3-piece legs, box them in custom cardboard, blanket the mirror, shrink-wrap the legs to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.52 Tm (it and add a fragile sticker, because the loaded pod tilts high [FirehouseEducation - Appti0ctcGA @ 00:04:17].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.30 Tm (Section 3: Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.07 Tm (Odor control is the sharpest split. Annissa Coy at FirehouseEducation bans ozone outright on contents with an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.85 Tm ("absolutely not," because it bleaches anything damp and takes years off leather. Coy runs hydroxyl inside the drying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.62 Tm (chamber instead, since it is safe for occupants and works on wet goods [MkCNqNRsk04 @ 00:06:05]. Chris, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.40 Tm (umpire-appraiser teaching Encircle's bootcamp, reverses that ranking. On protein fires Chris rates ozone above hydroxy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.17 Tm (and calls hydroxy three to four times weaker. Chris still holds that the most effective removal is physical, not hydroxy,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.95 Tm (and warns that whoever over-oxidizes a house owns the result [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 02:59:48]. The lever Chris prefers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.72 Tm (was used by only 3 to 4 percent of attendees: fresh-air dilution. The reasoning is that bringing fresh air in carries less) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.50 Tm (risk than applying another product [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 03:02:49]. Travis Chauncey at Abbotts Cleanup & Restoration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 182.27 Tm (runs a homeowner-grade version. Open doors and windows, put positive air pressure in some areas and negative air) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.05 Tm (machines in the affected ones, and move to demolition only if the odor persists [iiCSRcut-WA @ 00:00:43]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.82 Tm (working read is that contents crews lean toward hydroxyl, while structure-side dispute experts lean toward physical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.60 Tm (removal plus dilution. None of these operators treats an oxidizer as a substitute for actual cleaning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.37 Tm (The packout call is driven by damage load, not habit. Annissa Coy of FirehouseEducation sends medium to heavy fire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.15 Tm (jobs, and anything that needs ultrasonic work, to the warehouse. Light smoke gets cleaned in place to avoid the expense) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 90.92 Tm (and hassle. Coy still runs a partial packout on light jobs when the structure needs paint or carpet work [w85_KBcX690) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 75.70 Tm (@ 00:00:49]. Coy's four decision factors are degree of damage, need for ultrasonic, intensity of cleaning, and structural) Tj ET
