BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (damage. Coy states flatly that structural damage often forces the crew to pack contents up and get them out of the way) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (so it can handle the structure [w85_KBcX690 @ 00:01:56]. Brendy Riley, a project manager with 11 years at Octagon,) Tj ET
