BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (anything goes into a box.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (The sharpest arguments over documentation tooling are about accuracy and about who structures the data. Kylee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Kempton, the Matterport technician at Titan Restoration, pitches scanning as the cure for digging through 700 photos) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (and making return trips to the site. Kempton claims correct scans are far more accurate than photos and that floor plans) Tj ET
