BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (side and says accuracy is where Matterport falls off a cliff. In that firm's view Matterport is fine for quick-and-dirty) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (floor plans and visuals but unfit for millimeter or centimeter construction documents, and mirrors throw phantom walls) Tj ET
