BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.77 Tm (The costliest failures come from letting someone else own the scope. Chris describes a loss of more than $600,000 in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.55 Tm (which an untrained adjuster changed the scope and the contractor followed it. The contractor ultimately was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.32 Tm (responsible, so the rule taught is never to take work instructions from the adjuster [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 00:09:57]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 496.10 Tm (same instructor saw a contractor seal odor into a senior home's roof without offering options, on a roughly $800,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.87 Tm (invoice, and the firm was left holding the bag [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 00:59:47]. Brendy Riley of Octagon answers with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.65 Tm (scope discipline set early. Build a hard scope with the adjuster upfront, raise new items the moment they appear so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.42 Tm (there are no surprises, and meet adjusters on site, since there may be several. On a 7,000-square-foot ski-resort home, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 435.20 Tm (stain rag combusted over a weekend. The smoke path stayed invisible until the drywall came off, and engineers pushed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.97 Tm (back on the estimates. The crew still got paid for the correct scope, which Riley credits to having the photo) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.75 Tm (documentation to justify it and the knowledge to convey it [WTz841eMFkk @ 00:11:32]. Chris's economics check) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.52 Tm (matches that experience: establishing the objective at the beginning makes it easier to get paid at the end) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.30 Tm ([33iGNdZ6fyE @ 00:05:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.07 Tm (Chemistry mistakes cannot be undone, which is why practitioners treat them as economic traps rather than technique) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.85 Tm (notes. Annissa Coy warns that you cannot ozone an item that is damp or wet, because it bleaches the goods and takes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.62 Tm (years off leather. Soft goods get no ozone at all [MkCNqNRsk04 @ 00:06:22]. Chris goes further on structures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.40 Tm (Over-oxidation cannot be reversed, houses have ended up transferred to insurers because of it, and many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.17 Tm (cleaning-chemical labels already read "Do not expose to oxidizers" [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 02:59:48]. Protein fires are the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.95 Tm (other money pit, accounting for about 60 percent of Chris's disputes. The residue is invisible and tacky, it hardens like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.72 Tm (shellac within 24 to 72 hours, and oxidizers do little against it. Chris's warning is that protein fires are expensive, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.50 Tm (no physical damage and simply a ton of cleaning [33iGNdZ6fyE @ 00:36:30]. Coy also forbids homeowner laundry on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.27 Tm (fire jobs, because it obscures the source of any remaining odor. Textiles go in-house or to a certified vendor rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 222.05 Tm (Suzy's Wash and Fold [MkCNqNRsk04 @ 00:09:05]. The common thread is that once a residue has been sealed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.82 Tm (oxidized, or washed by the wrong hands, the restorer can no longer prove what is causing the lingering smell.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.60 Tm (Packout and paperwork failures drain margin quietly. Annissa Coy and Jeremy of Faithful Restoration in Billings name) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.37 Tm (the two classic packout losses: damage in transit, and cleaned items going dusty in storage and needing a second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 161.15 Tm (cleaning. Jeremy draws on 15 years at a furniture store plus moving labor. The fix is full shrink-wrap, moving blankets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.92 Tm (on corners, and taking pieces apart before loading, such as a floor mirror's three screw-in legs, because the pod tilts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.70 Tm (high once it is loaded [Appti0ctcGA @ 00:00:53]. Coy adds a heat trap: in hot areas, paper-wrap wood before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.47 Tm (shrink wrap goes on. Coy also says never to skimp on billable materials, citing bubble wrap at about twenty dollars a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.25 Tm (box [rAAR3Zmm80c @ 00:03:46]. Frank Pedu at Omegasonics treats a digital photo inventory as the minimum, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 85.02 Tm (the goal, because it protects the company from fraudulent claims and misplaced contents. Each item's original condition) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 69.80 Tm (and final storage location should be logged [3UmvqUcOFDc @ 00:01:09]. On the estimating side, American Roof) Tj ET
