BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (platforms. Every number in this chapter, from referral trees to close rates, sits downstream of that one acquisition skill.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Practitioners treat the plumber channel as the base layer of a water company, not a side campaign run when the phones) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (go quiet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (The second point of agreement is that you diagnose before you pitch. Shane's core rule is to find out what the plumber) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (wants and give it to them. The options run from referral fees to leads to free tryouts, a combination, or none of those) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm ([D4BavFC6d1E @ 00:01:28]. Marketing Ninjas warns that walking in with a flyer or gift card attached to a pitch blows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (the visit. They use discovery questions instead, including asking about bad experiences the plumber has had with other) Tj ET
