BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (When the lender's name is on the check, the practitioners run a paperwork machine. Garrett Eriksson of Integrity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Roofing and Painting, whose shop does about 97% of its work through insurance claims, tells owners to call the local) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (branch first; the lucky version is walking in and getting the check endorsed, the hard version demands the contractor's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (license or insurance, a W-9, a signed lien waiver, the insurance scope and a contract whose price matches the claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (estimate [Mi6XZq4h6yo @ 00:01:07]. Garrett adds that lenders may ask for a draw schedule and hold back a final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (payment until the owner calls for the lender's inspector after the roof is done [Mi6XZq4h6yo @ 00:02:53]. Richard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Levisee of Acumen Contracting routes everything through the lender's loss draft department and reports one package) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (that releases claims under $10,000 with no holdback, while claims over $10,000 trigger inspections, including a 50%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (inspection that roofs and gutters skip because they finish in one to two days [VFWDHse67ws @ 00:06:48]. Richard's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (speed hacks: overnight, fax and email the identical packet so one misplaced sheet cannot stall the claim, and file a third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (party authorization so they can chase the lender every three days, because lenders never call when something is missing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm ([VFWDHse67ws @ 00:08:05].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Chad Michael treats the deductible problem as an opportunity rather than a reason to lie. The engine is ACV-only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (coverage: other structures such as fences, sheds and playgrounds often carry non-recoverable depreciation, marked by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (brackets instead of parentheses, and Chad learned that the hard way on an ACV bed-and-breakfast job, doing all the) Tj ET
