BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (becomes deductible money: if the owner skips that ACV work, Chad says the client goes from $1,798 short to $1,307) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (ahead, usually paid on a separate check that can be signed straight over to the contractor, and Chad tells the adjuster) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (exactly what they did with it [DmesIP8hcak @ 00:27:55]. When no ACV money exists, Chad's last-resort move is) Tj ET
