BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (all insurance proceeds, and the subcontract is kept as a separate transaction [DmesIP8hcak @ 00:30:48]. Chad calls this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (creative financing, raised as a matter of course through a two-to-three-hour inspection of every room, closet and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (elevation. State Restoration Services sells the same promise in plainer terms, saying it is not waiving or rebating the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (deductible, yet 99% of the time the owner gets a new roof and pays absolutely nothing [06ChGuOZCto @ 00:01:16].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (Two filters decide whether a claim or a refund is worth chasing. The Deductible channel runs the fender-bender math: a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm ($900 repair against a $500 deductible pays $400, but a 30% at-fault surcharge on a $2,000-a-year policy adds $600 a) Tj ET
